      DependencyIndex: 143
      LevelID: 6
      NodeType: 3
      Ports:
        Description:
          String: ""
        DescriptionText:
          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |-
            Aligns particle quads to face their render camera and, optionally, orient and stretch along the particle’s velocity vector. 
            
            Stretch Amount controls how much the particle is scaled along the velocity vector. 
            
            When Stretch Amount is 0, particles only face the camera and are oriented relative to the camera’s up vector.
